<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Nov unemployment rises 11.1 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Nov unemployment rises 11.1 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Ukraine rose to 308,350 at the end of November from 277,468 at the end of October, the Statistics Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>It gave the following data:</p>
<p> UKRAINIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	  NOV 96     OCT 96     NOV 95</p>
<p> number of unemployed	    308,350    277,468    112,589</p>
<p> mth/mth change (percent)	+11.1	+7.7	 +8.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Official Ukrainian information tends to understate unemployment levels.</p>
<p>Ukrainian Labor Minister Mykola Biloblodsky said last month that registered unemployment stood at about 0.9 percent of the workforce, but real unemployment was about 3.5 million.</p>
<p>Ukraine's workforce is estimated at 27.7 million.</p>
<p>The government has forecast that registered unemployment will rise to 1.3 million by the end of next year.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
